 * only mono-black or colourless commanders, and picking {B, G} keeps only
 * mono-black, mono-green, Golgari, or colourless. A colourless commander's
 * empty identity is a subset of any set, so it always passes a colour
 * include. "Exclude" remains the literal complement, dropping any identity
 * that touches an excluded color.
